Phase 1: The Foundation (Current Focus)\
\pard\pardeftab560\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\fs18 \cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\fs26 Audio Engine Setup: Initialize Web Audio API and a ScriptProcessorNode or AudioWorklet.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\fs18 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\fs26 The Orbit Engine: Create the mathematical "playhead" (the orbit) that moves across the X/Y coordinates of your terrain.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\fs18 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\fs26 Coordinate Mapping: Logic to translate "Orbit Position" $\\to$ "Terrain Height" $\\to$ "Audio Amplitude."\
\pard\pardeftab560\sa40\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf0 Phase 2: Data Ingestion & Terrain Generation\
\pard\pardeftab560\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\fs18 \cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\fs26 Sample-to-Terrain: Convert 1D arrays (audio) into 2D matrices.\
\ls2\ilvl0
\fs18 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\fs26 Image Processing: Canvas-based pixel extraction (Luminance) to create 512x512 height maps.\
\ls2\ilvl0
\fs18 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\fs26 Vector Support: Parsing SVG data into coordinate paths for the orbit to follow.\
\pard\pardeftab560\sa40\partightenfactor0

